  "description": "Azure Blob media storage provider for Umbraco 15/16/17/18 (.NET 9/10). Built on Umbraco.StorageProviders.AzureBlob and Umbraco.StorageProviders.AzureBlob.ImageSharp, it configures Azure Blob media and ImageSharp cache with auto-composition, provider-client startup validation, Managed Identity support, and bounded multi-instance cache retention.",
