  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 - Breaking: the public type AzureBlobSmokeTestsMiddleware is no longer published and diagnostic smoke support moved out of the package, leaving AzureBlobComposer as the only public type and shipping runtime code only. Installations relying on auto-composition are unaffected. Also hardens the compatibility hosts against unattended database upgrades and drops the redundant Umbraco.Cms.Web.Common dependency.",
